{
 "id": "288-39",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "I want you to forget about the ticketing system entirely.",
  "Don't use it.",
  "They certainly are common, but here at FORTUNA, we like to do things a bit differently.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out and engage in conversations.",
  "That's how we build a strong and cohesive team.",
  "Of course, if you need to report something urgently or escalate an issue, we have other channels for that, which I'll be happy to walk you through.",
  "But for day-to-day tasks and queries, direct interaction is the way to go.",
  "Anytime, Noah.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you need anything at all.",
  "PIPs can be utilized by anyone looking to advance their skills, take on new challenges, or even prepare for a promotional opportunity.",
  "When writing functions, I want you to always start function argument names with 'i_'.",
  "This is a convention we follow at Fortuna to enhance code readability and maintain consistency across our projects.",
  "Additionally, comprehensive docstrings are a must for all functions.",
  "Clear and concise documentation makes it easier for others to understand your code, and it's a hallmark of professional software engineering.",
  "Remember, if you have any questions or feedback\u2014which I encourage\u2014don't hesitate to reach out.",
  "We encourage a healthy balance of remote work and office presence here at Fortuna.",
  "Let's settle on a maximum of three days per week for now.",
  "It's important to maintain a presence in the office, especially for collaboration and team bonding.",
  "We can always reassess and adjust as needed, but I think this will be a good starting point for you to get into a productive routine."
 ],
 "admitted": 19,
 "relations_applied": 0,
 "overflow": 270,
